---
title: How to add an Image block in the document
sidebar:
  order: 3
---
**To add an image block in the document, follow these steps:**

1. **Insert the Image Block:**

   - **Start typing `/image` in the document where you want to insert the image.**
   - **A dropdown menu will appear. Select the “Image” option.**

1. **Upload the Image:**

   - **A file upload box will appear after inserting the image block.**
   - **Click on the box and either drag and drop your image file or click to upload an image from your device. The image file should be under 20 MB.**

1. **Edit Image Options:**

   - **Once the image is uploaded, options to replace the image, download it, or adjust its alignment (left, center, or right) will appear.**
   - **You can use these options to adjust the image positioning and modify it as needed.**

**By following these steps, you will successfully add an image to your document.**
